    <string name="whats_new_title">What\'s new in 1.3.0</string>
    <string name="whats_new_body">Google sign-in added, with the subscription linked to the account\n\nPaid subscription added, payable via YooMoney\n\nDedicated server in France plus a server switcher\n\nTelegram channel and Support buttons that open the chat\n\nThe “Support the project” button is renamed to “Thank the developer”\n\nScreenshot and screen recording blocking added\n\nTunnel logs added to the event journal\n\nRuStore mentions removed from the app\n\nFaster connects and reconnects, tunnel freeze fixed\n\nFree version fixed: DNS failures gone, service access through the tunnel restored\n\nSome app vulnerabilities fixed</string>

